              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Take in `otpId` and code in the request body. It checks if the provided\ncode matches the one-time password generated for the OTP request and\nreturns the result. Does not require a minimum authentication standard.\n**This API is mandatory.**\n"
